e` on the current session, which is the database write.\n\nTwo things I did not verify: the `OrderDAO` interface declaration, and the body of `saveOrderInternal`. The `openmrs2_2` `FulfillerDetailsResource2_2` also exists but I did not open it, since the chart's `fulfillerdetails` call resolves to the `2_3` resource.\n\nRepository note: the `openmrs-esm-patient-chart` checkout is local, but Falkon queries against it returned nothing, so the frontend citations come from the local files.\n\n```json\n[\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-chart/packages/esm-patient-orders-app/src/lab-results/lab-results.resource.ts\", \"startLine\": 327, \"endLine\": 336},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-chart/packages/esm-patient-orders-app/src/lab-results/lab-results.resource.ts\", \"startLine\": 278, \"endLine\": 296},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-chart/packages/esm-patient-orders-app/src/lab-results/lab-results.resource.ts\", \"startLine\": 302, \"endLine\": 325},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-chart/packages/esm-patient-orders-app/src/lab-results/exported-lab-results-form.workspace.tsx\", \"startLine\": 326, \"endLine\": 339},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-esm-patient-chart/packages/esm-patient-orders-app/src/lab-results/exported-lab-results-form.workspace.tsx\", \"startLine\": 245, \"endLine\": 248},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/v1_0/resource/openmrs2_3/FulfillerDetailsResource2_3.java\", \"startLine\": 34, \"endLine\": 48},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-module-webservices.rest/omod/src/main/java/org/openmrs/module/webservices/rest/web/v1_0/resource/openmrs2_2/FulfillerDetails2_2.java\", \"startLine\": 18, \"endLine\": 47},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/impl/OrderServiceImpl.java\", \"startLine\": 548, \"endLine\": 570},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-core/api/src/main/java/org/openmrs/api/OrderService.java\", \"startLine\": 367, \"endLine\": 368},\n  {\"path\": \"openmrs-co